/T (Shift-Share analysis is a technique to analyse changes within the structure of the local economy in comparison to the reference economy at a state or national scale \(Leigh & Blakely, 2016\). )
/E (Shift-Share analysis is a technique to analyse changes within the structure of the local economy in comparison to the reference economy at a state or national scale \(Leigh & Blakely, 2016\). )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [21]
